OL,3,GNEWSAFormer prison officer guilty of
OL,4,Aindecent behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former prison officer has been found
OL,7,Fguilty at Guernsey's Magistrate's Court
OL,8,Fof behaving in an indecent manner in a
OL,9,Fpublic place.
OL,11,FWayne David Le Cocq, 64, of Collings
OL,12,FRoad, St Peter Port, was convicted of
OL,13,Ffive counts of indecency, which he had
OL,14,Fdenied.
OL,16,FProsecuting, Crown Advocate Chris
OL,17,FDunford said Le Cocq engaged in sexual
OL,18,Facts around the island between 2021 and
OL,19,F2024, including at the Pulias Pond car
OL,20,Fpark and Moulin Huet cark park. In
OL,21,Fcourt, Le Cocq said the acts were not
OL,22,Findecent as nobody saw them happen.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
