OL,3,GNEWSAFormer prison officer guilty of
OL,4,Aindecent behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Marc Davies said no-one needed to
OL,7,Fsee an incident or complain for it to
OL,8,Fbe indecent. A probation report is to
OL,9,Fbe prepared, with Le Cocq due back in
OL,10,Fcourt on 15 October.
